      "writtenOn": "2021-09-08T17:40:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have the same hesitations; can you elaborate a bit on how skip-mode might help us iterate more quickly? I\u0027d be concerned to use this mode, myself, as I fear it would mask issues. I also am quite resistant to having it be the default.",
      "parentUuid": "49929d00_502479f3",
